# --- Dependencies: installed FRESH inside the image (host copy is Windows-specific) ---
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# --- Build outputs: recompiled inside the image ---
**/dist
**/.next
**/build
**/.turbo

# --- Prisma generated client: regenerated inside the image ---
apps/api/src/generated

# --- Secrets: NEVER copy into an image ---
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# --- Git & CI metadata: not needed to run the app ---
.git
.github
.gitignore

# --- Editor / OS cruft ---
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log

# --- Non-runtime files: docs, Postman, markdown ---
docs
postman
**/*.md

# --- Tests: not shipped in the production image ---
**/*.spec.ts
**/test
coverage